  m_text: The story follows the Tayar family as they struggle to fit their personal
    and public lives in the predominantly Christian country of Malta. The player
    retraces the markings they left in Maltese history, starting from the focal point,
    Ondina Tayar, to her mother Rachele, her brother Oscar, and then ending with
    the initial struggle of Jewish immigrants landing in Malta. All of the Tayar
    stories offer an individual look into Jewish struggles in Malta while also relating
    them to those of the general Jewish residents of Malta.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3dab4aaee5eb57b49bb411e395a45278, type: 2}
