      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "QUARANTINE STORY 1813 - The story follows the execution of Antonio Borg,
    who was killed because he broke the quarantine mandate. The player retraces the
    steps to understand why there was a quarantine mandate, where most infections
    in Valletta were to be found, what the first case was, and finally how the plague
    was spread in Malta due to illegal smuggling activities. Lastly, the player is
    prompted to go watch the Lazzaretto quarantine spot from Valletta overlooking
    Manoel Island. \r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3dab4aaee5eb57b49bb411e395a45278, type: 2}
